OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day and the B&Bers
OL,7,     Fmeet for one last time to settle
OL,8,     Fsome scores and find out how much
OL,9,     Fthey've been paid. But some of the
OL,10,     Fhosts' emotions run away with
OL,11,     Fthem.
OL,12,G2000 Griff's Canadian Adventure
OL,13,     FFrom Winnipeg to Churchill, Griff
OL,14,     FRhys Jones explores the Frozen
OL,15,     FWilds of Canada's north, in
OL,16,     FManitoba. He goes dog sledding and
OL,17,     Fvisits a town with more polar
OL,18,     Fbears than people. (Ep4/6)
